      "answer_outline": "The candidate should mention specific WCAG principles like providing text alternatives for charts (e.g., summary tables), ensuring focus management, and using ARIA labels appropriately. They should demonstrate an understanding that accessibility isn't an afterthought but a core requirement for data-intensive enterprise tools.",
